#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 32
#: rc.cpp:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can enter how much memory KDE should use for caching the "
"background(s). If you have different backgrounds for the different desktops "
"caching can make switching desktops smoother at the expense of higher memory "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Asyaq süräten alxäterläw öçen qullanası xäter külämen monda kürsätep bula. "
"Törle öställärdäge sürätlär törle bulğançaqta, alxärefläw şul öställär arasında "
"küçüne yomışağraq itä ala, läkin qullanılğan xäter küläme dä artır."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 38
#: rc.cpp:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show icons on desktop"
msgstr "İkonnarnı östäldä kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 39
#: rc.cpp:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Uncheck this option if you do not want to have icons on the desktop. Without "
"icons the desktop will be somewhat faster but you will no longer be able to "
"drag files to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"Östäl östendä ikonnar telämäsäñ, monı tamğalama. Östäl östendä ikonnar "
"bulmağanda sistem tizräk eşlär, ämmä östäl östenä fayllarnı österäw artıq "
"mömkin bulmas."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 43
#: rc.cpp:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allow programs in desktop window"
msgstr "Östäldä yazılımnarnı çığarunı açası"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 44
#: rc.cpp:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run X11 programs that draw into the desktop "
"such as xsnow, xpenguin or xmountain. If you have problems with applications "
"like netscape that check the root window for running instances, disable this "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Xsnow, Xpenguin, Xmountain kebek östäl östenä yazğan X11 yazılımnarın eşläwen "
"tä'min itär öçen monı sayla. Tamır täräzädäge cibärmälärne tikşergän Netscape "
"kebek yazılımnar belän bäläläreñ bulsa, bu saylanmanı sälätsez it."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 55
#: rc.cpp:131
#, no-c-format
