msgstr "İkon yazmalarına asyaq tösen qullanası"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 131
#: rc.cpp:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable text shadow"
msgstr "Yazma tösmerläwen sälätli"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 132
#: rc.cpp:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check here to enable a shadow outline around the desktop font. This also "
"improves the readability of the desktop text against backgrounds of a similar "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Eş östäle xäreflären tiräli külägäläw mömkinlegen monda tamğalağız. Ul eş "
"östäle tekstınıñ berdäy töstäge fonda uqılışın da yaxşırtır."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 145
#: rc.cpp:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show hidden files"
msgstr "Yäşeren birem kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 146
#: rc.cpp:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you check this option, any files in your desktop directory that begin "
"with a period (.) will be shown. Usually, such files contain configuration "
"information, and remain hidden from view.</p>\\n"
"<p>For example, files which are named \\\".directory\\\" are plain text files "
"which contain information for Konqueror, such as the icon to use in displaying "
"a directory, the order in which files should be sorted, etc. You should not "
"change or delete these files unless you know what you are doing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, noqta (.) belän başlanğan biremnär östäldä kürengän "
"bulır. Ğädättä isä, andí biremnär caylawlarnı saqlaw öçen qullanılıp, "
"kürenmäslek yäşerelgän bula.</p>\\n"
"<p>ü.ö., \\\".directory\\\" itep atalağan biremnärdä Konqueror öçen belem "
"saqlana, alar arasında: törgäklärne nindi ikon belän kürsätäse, biremnärne "
"niçegräk tezäse, w.b. Ni eşlägäneñ belmägän çaqta, bu biremnärne "
"üzgärtergä/beterergä kiräkmi.</p>"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 150
#: rc.cpp:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Align direction"
msgstr "Urnaşılu yünäleşe"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 151
#: rc.cpp:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, icons are aligned vertically, otherwise horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Bu açılğan bulsa, ikonnar asama buyınça tezeler, yä isä inde yatma buyınça."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 155
#: rc.cpp:213
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show Icon Previews For"
msgstr "Boları öçen Kürep alu İkonın Kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 156
#: rc.cpp:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select for which types of files you want to enable preview images."
msgstr "Alküreneş kürergä telägän birem törlären sayla."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 170
#: rc.cpp:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sort criterion"
msgstr "Tezü cayı"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 171
#: rc.cpp:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets the sort criterion. Possible choices are NameCaseSensitive = 0, "
"NameCaseInsensitive = 1, Size = 2, Type = 3, Date = 4."
msgstr ""
"Tezü tärtiben bilgeli. Quyıp bula torğannarı bu: NameCaseSensitive = 0, "
"NameCaseInsensitive = 1, Size = 2, Type = 3, Date = 4."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 176
#: rc.cpp:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable this to place directories in front of the sorted list, otherwise they "
"are amongst the files."
msgstr ""
"Monı açqaç, törgäklär tärtiplängän tezmäneñ başında urnaşılırlar, yä isä "
"biremnärdañ soñ."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 181
#: rc.cpp:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check this option if you want to keep your icons from moving."
msgstr ""
"Check this option if you want to keep your icons from moving.Bu köylämne açıp, "
"ikonnarnı küçerüdän saqlap bula."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 202
#: rc.cpp:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Device Types to exclude"
msgstr "Kürsätelmi torğan Cıhaz Törläre"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 203
#: rc.cpp:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "The device types which you do not want to see on the desktop."
msgstr "Östäldä küräse kilmägän cıhaz törläre."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 211
#: rc.cpp:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "Current application's menu bar (Mac OS-style)"
msgstr "Biredäge yazılımnıñ saylağı (Mac OS'ta kebek)"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 212
#: rc.cpp:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, applications will not have their menu bar attached "
"to their own window anymore. Instead, there is one menu bar at the top of the "
"screen which shows the menus of the currently active application. You might "
"recognize this behavior from Mac OS."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylanğan bulsa, eştä bulğan yazılımnıñ saylaq tiräse üz täräzädä tügel, Mac "
"OS'ta bkebek, küräk östendäge saylaq tiräsendä bulaçaq."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 218
#: rc.cpp:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "Desktop menu bar"
msgstr "Östäl saylaq tiräse"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 219
#: rc.cpp:256
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, there is one menu bar at the top of the screen "
"which shows the desktop menus."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylanğan bulsa, östäl saylaqların kürsätkän saylaqtirä küräk östendä "
"bulaçaq."

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 225
#: rc.cpp:259
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable screen saver"
msgstr "Küräk saqlawçısın sälätlä"

#. i18n: file kdesktop.kcfg line 226
#: rc.cpp:262
#, no-c-format
